Hello, every one! Thank you all who have been playing Satellite Rush!
Based on the feedbacks we've received on these starting weeks, we have our first update.
 
Here's what's new:
- "Options" added to the menus, where you can adjust the sound volume of the game;
- Fixed an issue where hiting "Erase Data" was not working properly in specific circunstances and other small bug fixes;
- Slight level design adjustments;

Keep on playing and keep it up with the feedbacks! Time to begin working on the next update :)

